{"id":"0a9a8cb11b4dac7a","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-kauffman-bracket.md","title":"Kauffman Bracket","display":"df-kauffman-bracket — Kauffman Bracket","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-kauffman-bracket","aliases":["58-df-kauffman-bracket","58-thm-kauffman-bracket"],"display":"df-kauffman-bracket — Kauffman Bracket","depends_on":["[[58-df-knot-diagram]]","[[58-df-bracket-polynomial]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-kauffman-bracket"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-kauffman-bracket</span><span>58-thm-kauffman-bracket</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kauffman-bracket — Kauffman Bracket"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"45d02e8df3a08d98\" href=\"?note=45d02e8df3a08d98\" title=\"58-df-knot-diagram\">58-df-knot-diagram</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d43649881d4bfbbd\" href=\"?note=d43649881d4bfbbd\" title=\"58-df-bracket-polynomial\">58-df-bracket-polynomial</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,K,q,h,\\pi,o,A,\\mathcal S,a,b,c,B\\in V\">\\(D,K,q,h,\\pi,o,A,\\mathcal S,a,b,c,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BracketStateSum}_S:V^{12}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{BracketStateSum}_S:V^{12}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d43649881d4bfbbd\" href=\"?note=d43649881d4bfbbd\" title=\"58-df-bracket-polynomial\">58-df-bracket-polynomial</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KauffmanBracket}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{KauffmanBracket}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kauffman\\text{-}bracket} \\vdash \\mathrm{KauffmanBracket}_S(B,D,K,q,h,\\pi,o,A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal S,a,b,c\\in V\\;\\mathrm{BracketStateSum}_S(B,D,K,q,h,\\pi,o,\\mathcal S,a,b,c,A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kauffman\\text{-}bracket} \\vdash \\mathrm{KauffmanBracket}_S(B,D,K,q,h,\\pi,o,A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal S,a,b,c\\in V\\;\\mathrm{BracketStateSum}_S(B,D,K,q,h,\\pi,o,\\mathcal S,a,b,c,A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该定义复用上游的显式有限 smoothing 数据，不再调用上游特意未定义的简写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle D\\rangle_A\">\\(\\langle D\\rangle_A\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>Kauffman bracket is a regular-isotopy invariant once canonical smoothing data and the Reidemeister invariance proofs are supplied; writhe normalization then produces the Jones polynomial.</li>\n<li>在上游采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(-A^2-A^{-2})^{c(s)-1}\">\\((-A^2-A^{-2})^{c(s)-1}\\)</span> 的 convention 下，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\bigcirc\\rangle_A=1\">\\(\\langle\\bigcirc\\rangle_A=1\\)</span>；额外平凡圆才乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-A^2-A^{-2}\">\\(-A^2-A^{-2}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>Skein relation: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle \\times \\rangle = A \\langle \\asymp \\rangle + A^{-1} \\langle \\cup \\rangle\">\\(\\langle \\times \\rangle = A \\langle \\asymp \\rangle + A^{-1} \\langle \\cup \\rangle\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Unnormalized gives state sum; normalized gives Jones polynomial.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-knot-diagram","status":"resolved","id":"45d02e8df3a08d98","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-knot-diagram]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bracket-polynomial","status":"resolved","id":"d43649881d4bfbbd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bracket-polynomial]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bracket-polynomial","status":"resolved","id":"d43649881d4bfbbd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BracketStateSum}_S:V^{12}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-bracket-polynomial]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D,K,q,h,\\pi,o,A,\\mathcal S,a,b,c,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BracketStateSum}_S:V^{12}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KauffmanBracket}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kauffman\\text{-}bracket} \\vdash \\mathrm{KauffmanBracket}_S(B,D,K,q,h,\\pi,o,A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal S,a,b,c\\in V\\;\\mathrm{BracketStateSum}_S(B,D,K,q,h,\\pi,o,\\mathcal S,a,b,c,A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle D\\rangle_A","display":false},{"tex":"(-A^2-A^{-2})^{c(s)-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\bigcirc\\rangle_A=1","display":false},{"tex":"-A^2-A^{-2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle \\times \\rangle = A \\langle \\asymp \\rangle + A^{-1} \\langle \\cup \\rangle","display":false}],"bytes":1423,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-731","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-kauffman-bracket.md|58-df-kauffman-bracket]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["45d02e8df3a08d98","d43649881d4bfbbd"]}